   - The last action committed and pushed the seventh-round Pyro/Triad fixes ("Pyro and Triad profiles: seventh-review fixes applied (proposals, unlocked)"). The fix agent reported all 12 items applied, with gate exit 0 on both files.
   - The fourteenth LEX-draft review is still running in the background.

